  "stageId": "a003_05",
  "title": "Don't Stop Me Now",
  "storyCode": "OF-5",
  "avgTag": "Before Operation",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/activities/act3d0/level_act3d0_05_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "1fdae02150b97ed13f3404002faaaab582447d94597880defb0e60b081a605ce",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第六关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_sunnytown_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Broadcast",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Everyone, are you getting all fired up?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Broadcast",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "In order to welcome the hottest concert in the Obsidian Festival..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Broadcast",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Starting from 12 o'clock today, all the malls, recreational facilities, and even some of your favorite bars and restaurants will hold a variety of warm-up activities!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Broadcast",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You do not want to miss out!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_Festival_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Schwarz",
      "speakerId": "char_340_shwaz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I knew you'd come here, milady."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ceylon",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Schwarz..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Schwarz",
      "speakerId": "char_340_shwaz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I knew you'd come here. After Cronin turned you down, you'd try to use the broadcast tower to spread the news so that the entire city would hear it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Schwarz",
      "speakerId": "char_340_shwaz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "This won't work, milady. It will only cause confusion and chaos."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Schwarz",
      "speakerId": "char_340_shwaz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Perhaps you hate your father and this city, but Master Doykos has already given enough. This will lead to the demise of the Obsidian Festival and Siesta as a whole."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ceylon",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I know that the news will cause an uproar and maybe even have far-reaching consequences, but the truth needs to be heard."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Schwarz",
      "speakerId": "char_340_shwaz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I know Master Doykos has made mistakes in the past. Though he has done a lot of wrong, Siesta would not exist were it not for his actions."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ceylon",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "This has nothing to do with that!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Schwarz",
      "speakerId": "char_340_shwaz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Feel free to criticize me if you must, but please do not do something that is beyond redemption."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ceylon",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Do you... do you really think I'm just some child throwing a temper tantrum?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Schwarz",
      "speakerId": "char_340_shwaz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "No, milady. I'll try to persuade Master Doykos, I promise you. But just for now, let's head back together."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ceylon",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Schwarz... Don't talk to me like that."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Schwarz",
      "speakerId": "char_340_shwaz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I know you and Master Doykos currently do not see eye to eye, but for the time being, you should head home first."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ceylon",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I told you not to talk to me like that! I know that you're trying to mend our relationship, but could you not be like that?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ceylon",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Why can't you treat me like you used to? Talk to me as a friend, Schwarz!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Schwarz",
      "speakerId": "char_340_shwaz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I am simply a servant of the Doykos family."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ceylon",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Don't say that, Schwarz. I don't want to hear you talk like that! What happened to you? Why would you treat me like this?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Schwarz",
      "speakerId": "char_340_shwaz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cronin's Henchman",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_020",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What are you doing? Seize her this instant!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Schwarz",
      "speakerId": "char_340_shwaz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...She is the master's daughter. Watch your words."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cronin's Henchman",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_020",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But the mayor told you to give your full support to Mister Cronin! Are you going to let her destroy Siesta with her poisonous rumors?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Schwarz",
      "speakerId": "char_340_shwaz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...Use your brain for a moment. She came here alone, without even the slightest show of anxiety..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Schwarz",
      "speakerId": "char_340_shwaz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Do you really think she's trying to enter the broadcast tower?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cronin's Henchman",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_020",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Schwarz",
      "speakerId": "char_340_shwaz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Forget it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Schwarz",
      "speakerId": "char_340_shwaz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Milady, you're using yourself to distract me, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ceylon",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...You still know me well."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Schwarz",
      "speakerId": "char_340_shwaz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I wouldn't say that, milady. But since you didn't deny it, I can surmise as much."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ceylon",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Right now, Rhodes Island should already be at the City Hall."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cronin's Henchman",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_020",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Wh-what?! That's not a part of the plan! What's going on at the City Hall?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Schwarz",
      "speakerId": "char_340_shwaz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'd assume the thugs over there are getting a good beating just about now."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_offce"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cronin's Bodyguard",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_020",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Why's it so quiet out there? I told them to hurry up and carry the materials away. They dare slack off on such an urgent task?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cronin's Bodyguard",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_020",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hmm? What was that noise? Did another fight break out? Whatever, I need to finish that task..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Girl's Voice",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Sir, please open the door! We have a package to deliver!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cronin's Bodyguard",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_020",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(Huh? Did any of you order something?)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cronin's Bodyguard",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_020",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(No? That's weird...)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cronin's Bodyguard",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_020",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You've got the wrong address!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Girl's Voice",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But sir, the label on the parcel says it's right here...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cronin's Bodyguard",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_020",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Get lost! If you keep bothering us, I'm gonna teach you a lesson!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Girl's Voice",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cronin's Bodyguard",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_020",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Tsk... Sly little devil, trying to trick us again."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Girl's Voice",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ah, screw it! Doctor, stand aside, I'm kicking the door down!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Girl's Voice",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What?! Don't worry! I'm more than strong enough!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cronin's Bodyguard",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_020",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Huh?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vigna",
      "speakerId": "char_290_vigna",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hah!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cronin's Bodyguard",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_020",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Whaaaat?! The main door...! My god, what kind of monster are you—"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Goooaaaaaaaal!",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "Friends, you mustn't be so rude to the courier.",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vigna",
      "speakerId": "char_290_vigna",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hehe, I've always wanted to give that a try. And now, there's this line..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vigna",
      "speakerId": "char_290_vigna",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Um, ahem!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vigna",
      "speakerId": "char_290_vigna",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "'FBI! Open up!'"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "But you already kicked the door down...",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
